{
    "title": "Badoo Dating App: Meet & Date",
    "description": "<b>Boost your dating confidence on Badoo, the app designed for making real, genuine connections.</b>\r\n\r\nLooking for fun dates, a long-term thing, or casual chats? Experience a safe, encouraging space where expressing your true self can lead to making meaningful connections\u2013download Badoo now!\r\n\r\nWelcome to Badoo, the dating app that makes it <b>easier to date</b>. We\u2019re a little different from other free dating apps and dating sites.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re hoping to find \u2018the one\u2019, lots of ones or a number-one friend \u2013 we\u2019ve got you covered. Match your way, date your way. Meet new people your way. \r\n\r\nOur free dating app gives you the tools to put yourself out there. The real, unfiltered you. So if you\u2019re looking to meet new people and make new friends (online and irl), you can have confidence in the connection. \r\nPut the joy back into dating \u2013 download our free app today.\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Perks of using our dating app:</b><h2>\r\n-Your profile celebrates you, the real you\r\n-Easy to meet up with new people in your area\r\n-Can find something long-term, short-term or make friends!\r\n-Lots of ways to customise your profile\r\n-Inspires great chats and great dates\r\n-Can switch between message chats and video calls\r\n-Helps keep the spark going with long-distance relationships\r\n-Easily find friends with shared interests\r\n-Of course, LGBTQ+ friendly\r\n-Profiles can be checked out by your own approval committee (your pals on the app)\r\nIt\u2019s fun, flirty \u2013 and, because you can\u2019t put a price on that great-date feeling \u2013 free\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Features to help you on your dating adventure:</b></h2>\r\n-Shared intentions let you know where you stand\r\n-\u2018Chat before you match\u2019 lets you test the waters\r\n-Filters help finesse your search for a date\r\n-Profile prompts help to get those chat-balls rolling\r\n-Highlighted interests make it easy to spot potential dates and find friends\r\n-Fun, in-chat games can break the ice before you meet\r\n-Connecting with Apple Music makes it easy to make friends!\r\n-Video chat helps with getting to know people better (and quicker)\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Perks of dating with Premium Plus:</b></h2>\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Boosts chances of meeting perfect matches\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Can send a crush to kick-start a flirty chat\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Reveals who\u2019s already liked you\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Shows people who\u2019ve added you to their favourites\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Can undo your last \u2018no\u2019, if you change your mind\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Unlimited use of filters makes it easier to find friends and great matches\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Gives your messages top-priority to get those chats going\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Can go incognito, if you\u2019d like to limit who sees your profile\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f No ads! So you\u2019re free to date without distraction\r\n\r\n<h2><b>How our free dating app helps to keep you safe:</b></h2>\r\n- Our dating app has a one-stop shop for handy guides, tools & helplines - the 'Safety Space'\r\n- Photo verification checks people are who they say they are\r\n- Private detector flags (and initially blurs) inappropriate pictures\r\n- Rude message detector protects \u2013 and empowers \u2013 you when chatting to strangers and online friends\r\n- Selfie request helps you check people are still who they\u2019ve said they are, before you meet up irl\r\n- Block, report, and unmatch gives you complete control of your dating journey\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Diversity and inclusivity:</b></h2>\r\nAs we\u2019re big believers in the importance of recognition, we\u2019d like to make it super clear our free dating app is a safe space for all sexual orientations (lesbian, queer, gay-dating and all other kinds of dating), faith-based dating (Muslim, Jewish, Christian-dating...all beliefs) and all cultures. At Badoo, we welcome everyone.\r\n\r\n----\r\nBadoo is a dating app that is free to download and use. We also offer optional subscription packages and non-subscription, single, and multi-use paid features.\r\nYour personal data is securely stored on Badoo - be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions\r\nhttps://bumble.com/en/privacy\r\nhttps://bumble.com/en/terms\r\n\r\nBumble Inc. is the parent company of Bumble, Official, Bumble for Friends, along with the dating apps Badoo and Fruitz.</h2></h2>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Boost your dating confidence on Badoo, the app designed for making real, genuine connections.</b><br><br>Looking for fun dates, a long-term thing, or casual chats? Experience a safe, encouraging space where expressing your true self can lead to making meaningful connections\u2013download Badoo now!<br><br>Welcome to Badoo, the dating app that makes it <b>easier to date</b>. We\u2019re a little different from other free dating apps and dating sites.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re hoping to find \u2018the one\u2019, lots of ones or a number-one friend \u2013 we\u2019ve got you covered. Match your way, date your way. Meet new people your way. <br><br>Our free dating app gives you the tools to put yourself out there. The real, unfiltered you. So if you\u2019re looking to meet new people and make new friends (online and irl), you can have confidence in the connection. <br>Put the joy back into dating \u2013 download our free app today.<br><br><h2><b>Perks of using our dating app:</b><h2><br>-Your profile celebrates you, the real you<br>-Easy to meet up with new people in your area<br>-Can find something long-term, short-term or make friends!<br>-Lots of ways to customise your profile<br>-Inspires great chats and great dates<br>-Can switch between message chats and video calls<br>-Helps keep the spark going with long-distance relationships<br>-Easily find friends with shared interests<br>-Of course, LGBTQ+ friendly<br>-Profiles can be checked out by your own approval committee (your pals on the app)<br>It\u2019s fun, flirty \u2013 and, because you can\u2019t put a price on that great-date feeling \u2013 free<br><br><h2><b>Features to help you on your dating adventure:</b></h2><br>-Shared intentions let you know where you stand<br>-\u2018Chat before you match\u2019 lets you test the waters<br>-Filters help finesse your search for a date<br>-Profile prompts help to get those chat-balls rolling<br>-Highlighted interests make it easy to spot potential dates and find friends<br>-Fun, in-chat games can break the ice before you meet<br>-Connecting with Apple Music makes it easy to make friends!<br>-Video chat helps with getting to know people better (and quicker)<br><br><h2><b>Perks of dating with Premium Plus:</b></h2><br>\u2b50\ufe0f Boosts chances of meeting perfect matches<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Can send a crush to kick-start a flirty chat<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Reveals who\u2019s already liked you<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Shows people who\u2019ve added you to their favourites<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Can undo your last \u2018no\u2019, if you change your mind<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Unlimited use of filters makes it easier to find friends and great matches<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Gives your messages top-priority to get those chats going<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Can go incognito, if you\u2019d like to limit who sees your profile<br>\u2b50\ufe0f No ads! So you\u2019re free to date without distraction<br><br><h2><b>How our free dating app helps to keep you safe:</b></h2><br>- Our dating app has a one-stop shop for handy guides, tools &amp; helplines - the &#39;Safety Space&#39;<br>- Photo verification checks people are who they say they are<br>- Private detector flags (and initially blurs) inappropriate pictures<br>- Rude message detector protects \u2013 and empowers \u2013 you when chatting to strangers and online friends<br>- Selfie request helps you check people are still who they\u2019ve said they are, before you meet up irl<br>- Block, report, and unmatch gives you complete control of your dating journey<br><br><h2><b>Diversity and inclusivity:</b></h2><br>As we\u2019re big believers in the importance of recognition, we\u2019d like to make it super clear our free dating app is a safe space for all sexual orientations (lesbian, queer, gay-dating and all other kinds of dating), faith-based dating (Muslim, Jewish, Christian-dating...all beliefs) and all cultures. At Badoo, we welcome everyone.<br><br>----<br>Badoo is a dating app that is free to download and use. We also offer optional subscription packages and non-subscription, single, and multi-use paid features.<br>Your personal data is securely stored on Badoo - be sure to read our privacy policy and terms and conditions<br>https://bumble.com/en/privacy<br>https://bumble.com/en/terms<br><br>Bumble Inc. is the parent company of Bumble, Official, Bumble for Friends, along with the dating apps Badoo and Fruitz.</h2></h2>",
